 "name": "mammoth_costume",
 "description": "Doug's adult-coded deadpan mammoth suit (040, worn prop, anchor = Doug's hips, list AFTER Doug at the same x/y/scale/flip; stand, walk1/walk2). Brown felt barrel body (#7a5232, darker back #563720, lighter front), shaggy fur ticks and ragged hem, a dark shoulder hump behind the head, small felt ear, zipper down the back, a sewn-on felt trunk hanging forward to a dark webbing handle loop at its tip (local ~(140,130): the suitcase can hang there), two stiff ivory felt tusks curving forward and up (tips ~(250,-130)). No eyes on the suit: Doug's head, flat face and red cap stay fully visible above (suit top y -148). Pair with gear `fur_legs` for shaggy legs. Bbox x -156..252, y -192..152.",
